message: "This is an unreleased v4.0.0 candidate. If you reference it, identify it as an unreleased candidate."
title: "Disuza Quantitative Public Technical Reference"
abstract: >-
  Disuza Quantitative is a private, pre-deployment quantitative R&D initiative
  building and validating rule-based systematic trading infrastructure. This
  unreleased public-reference candidate distinguishes current, in-progress, and
  target state. Forward-only market-data capture supports research collection;
  it does not represent a live trading system, investment activity, investment
  performance, legal registration, or regulatory authorization.
